  m_Name: Temuri
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SuspectData
  FirstName: Temur
  LastName: Gelashvili
  Nickname: The Woodsman
  Occupation: Woodsman
  CharacterDescription: "Weathered face and heavy build. He is a man of the deep forest\u2014slow, deliberate, and smells of pine and smoke. He speaks rarely but with absolute certainty, his eyes constantly scanning the environment as if he\u2019s used to being tracked."
  CharacterArc: His arc is about animalistic survival; while the city dwellers panic over papers, he only cares about the shifting wind and the "wrongness" in the soil.
  DateOfBirth: 11/08/1957
  Sex: Male
  EntryPermitExpiryDate: 03 NOV
  IsResident: 1
  GivesPaperwork: 1
